What I would require before production
Item	My priority	Why
Affiliate / Advertiser Disclosure	🔴 Before launch	Your business model is affiliate-funded. Clearly disclose commissions and commercial relationships.
Financial information / advice disclaimer	🔴 Before launch	Clearly establish intended informational role, while recognising wording alone does not determine regulatory status.
Regulatory/legal review of your actual comparison + CTA model	🔴 Before launch	Determine whether any content/referral activity crosses into regulated financial services/advice/distribution.
Privacy Policy	🔴 Before collecting accounts/newsletters/analytics data	Must accurately reflect what you actually collect/use/share; potentially legally mandatory depending on Privacy Act coverage.
Terms of Use	🔴 Before launch	Not universally mandated as a page simply because a website exists, but essential for your type of site: reliance, third-party links, IP, availability, liability and acceptable use.
Comparison Methodology	🔴 Before launch	Particularly important because you rank/compare providers.
Editorial Policy	🔴 Before launch	Separates editorial decisions from affiliate revenue and establishes update/correction standards.
“How we make money” explanation	🔴 Before launch	I recommend making this exceptionally obvious rather than burying it inside Terms.
Coverage disclosure — “we do not compare every provider”	🔴 Before launch	Prevents users interpreting your table as a complete market comparison.
Sponsored/Featured labeling rules	🔴 Before accepting sponsored placements	Commercial ranking must never masquerade as independent editorial ranking.
Provider/data accuracy disclaimer	🔴 Before launch	Fees, features and regulatory status change; your project already tracks source dates, so expose that philosophy publicly.
Contact / Corrections / Complaints	🟠 Strongly recommended before launch	Gives users and providers a mechanism to challenge inaccuracies or commercial disclosure issues.
Cookie/privacy controls	🟠 Depends on tracking stack	Review once analytics, ad-tech, remarketing and international visitors are known.
Newsletter consent + unsubscribe implementation	🔴 Before newsletter marketing	Required when the feature goes live.
FSG / website disclosure information	⚠️ Conditional	Required if your actual activities/licensing situation brings those financial-services disclosure obligations into play.
TMD/DDO processes	⚠️ Conditional	Relevant if your activities amount to regulated retail product distribution conduct; don't blindly copy Canstar's wording.